            "author": "Nistha Agarwal",
            "body": "feat(guard): enforce ADR decisions on pull requests with the CIF guard\n\nAdds cif_rules.json with three human-reviewed, active guard rules derived\nfrom the ADRs, each citing the decision ID produced by CIF ingestion:\n\n- forbid sorting dispensable batches by received_on in\n  medstock/dispensing.py (FIFO, rejected in ADR-0002; FEFO per ADR-0003)\n- forbid a FIFO ordering helper anywhere in medstock/ (ADR-0002)\n- forbid importing psycopg2 in medstock/ (PostgreSQL rejected, ADR-0004)\n\ntools/cif_guard.py evaluates a diff with CIF's guard-rule engine and\nexits 1 on violations. The CIF Decision Guard workflow runs it on every\npull request against main.",
