          "rationale": "feat(api): add JSON HTTP API with an alerts feed for dashboard polling\n\nCounter terminals call POST /dispense and POST /receive; the alerts\ndashboard refreshes by polling GET /alerts every 30 seconds. The poll\ninterval is returned in the body (poll_interval_seconds) and the\nX-Poll-Interval header, with Cache-Control: no-store so proxies never\nserve",
