            "author": "Nistha Agarwal",
            "body": "feat(storage): migrate inventory storage from JSON file to SQLite (ADR-0004)\n\nDecided to replace the ADR-0001 JSON file with SQLite via the built-in\nsqlite3 module. With the HTTP API and a second counter terminal both\nwriting, two concurrent dispenses could each read the old JSON file and\none stock decrement was lost. Each write is now its own transaction, and\nCHECK / foreign-key constraints keep quantities non-negative and batches\ntied to registered medicines.\n\nADR-0004 supersedes ADR-0001. import_legacy_json() migrates an existing\ninventory.json in one transaction.\n\nRejected alternatives: a PostgreSQL server (too heavy for one pharmacy\nPC) and keeping the JSON file behind a lock file.",
            "event_id": "evt_git_nagarwal00_context-engine-repo_a4c30950bc",
