            "author": "Nistha Agarwal",
            "body": "feat(cif): add one-command CIF setup and step-by-step usage guide\n\ntools/cif_setup.py prepares a CIF database after this repository has been\ningested: it loads the rules from cif_rules.json (proposed by default, so\nthey are approved in the Review Queue; --activate to skip that), warns if\na cited decision or the repository registration is missing, and runs\nCIF's conflict and supersession detection, which the CIF server never\ntriggers itself.\n\ndocs/TESTING_WITH_CIF.md gains a \"Set up with your CIF project\" section\n(GitHub token, start the server, ingest, run cif_setup.py, approve rules,\nrun the drift check) and records the CIF ingest bugs this repository\nexposed and that were fixed on 21 November 2026.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
