            "rationale": "fix(dispensing): apply dispense plans atomically to stop lost updates\n\ndispense() read each batch, then wrote back an absolute quantity. Two\nterminals dispensing the same SKU at once could both read 30 units and\nboth write 30 minus their own units, so one sale vanished from the\nrecords - exactly the drift ADR-0004 set out to prevent.\n\nSQLiteStore.a",
            "state": "accepted",
            "step_number": 12,
            "summary": "[ACCEPTED] Apply dispense plans atomically to stop lost updates (by Nistha Agarwal on 2026-11-20)",
